    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Ad\u00e9wal\u00e9 is the Trinidad-born former enslaved man who becomes quartermaster to pirate Edward Kenway in Assassin's Creed IV: Black Flag. In the Freedom Cry expansion he takes the lead, using his Assassin skills to liberate enslaved people in Saint-Domingue."
   }
  },
  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "Who is Jax in Mortal Kombat?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Major Jackson 'Jax' Briggs is a U.S. Special Forces hero of the Mortal Kombat fighting games. After losing his arms in battle, Jax fights with powerful cybernetic replacements, and later passes the fight to his daughter Jacqui in defense of Earthrealm."
   }
  },
  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "Who is Tanya in Mortal Kombat?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Tanya is a skilled, ambitious fighter from the realm of Edenia in the Mortal Kombat games. Introduced as a seemingly loyal diplomat's daughter, Tanya repeatedly betrays heroes and villains alike to gain power, making her one of the series' great schemers."
   }
  },
  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "Who is Eddy Gordo in Tekken?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Eddy Gordo is the Afro-Brazilian capoeira fighter of the Tekken games. Imprisoned for a crime he did not commit, Eddy learned capoeira behind bars from a master, then entered the King of Iron Fist Tournament seeking revenge for his father's murder."
   }
  },
  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "Who is Raven in Tekken?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Raven is a cool, sunglasses-wearing secret agent and ninjutsu fighter in the Tekken games, working for an unnamed intelligence agency. Famous for calmly announcing 'He's dead' over fallen opponents, Raven investigates the Mishima Zaibatsu across several tournaments."
   }
  },
  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "Who is Balrog in Street Fighter?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Balrog is the heavy-hitting boxer of Capcom's Street Fighter games, a disgraced former champion from Las Vegas who became an enforcer for the criminal Shadaloo organization. One of the original four boss fighters, Balrog trades technique for raw punching power and greed."
   }
  },
  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "Who is Elena in Street Fighter?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Elena is a joyful Kenyan princess and capoeira fighter in the Street Fighter games. Fighting entirely with her legs in flowing, dance-like movements, Elena travels the world from her savanna home simply to make new friends, spreading happiness wherever tournaments take her."
   }
  },
  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "Who is Coach in Left 4 Dead 2?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Coach is one of the four playable survivors in Valve's zombie shooter Left 4 Dead 2. A former high school football coach from Savannah with a bad knee and a big appetite, he leads Ellis, Rochelle, and Nick across the infected American South."
   }
  },
  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "Who is Alyx Vance in Half-Life?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Alyx Vance is the skilled hacker and resistance fighter who partners with Gordon Freeman in Half-Life 2. Daughter of scientist Eli Vance, Alyx guides players through alien-occupied City 17 with her robot Dog, and later stars in her own virtual reality game, Half-Life: Alyx."
   }
  },
  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "Who is Franklin in Grand Theft Auto V?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Franklin Clinton is one of three playable heroes of Grand Theft Auto V. A young repo man from South Los Santos dreaming of a bigger life, Franklin's expert driving pulls him into heists with Michael and Trevor, and players decide his final loyalties."
   }
  },
  {
